                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good case of simple to learn hard to master. This is a simplistic match 3 time waster, with a nice twist. The level challenges are a good way to keep things interesting and add more difficulty, and gravity shifting mechanic means your lovely stratigy to get that nice big combo can be screwed up, or even made avaliable by those fun little blocks.\n\nNice varity in game types, and unlike any match three you'll find on facebook, you're never halted from that \"one more turn\" you want.\n\nI reccomend this to anyone who'se looking for something simple yet challenging.",
